{
  "id": "workshop",
  "title": "Clockwork Room",
  "theme": "castle",
  "start": "workshop",
  "intro": "Master Ottavio’s workshop smells of brass and machine oil. Every clock in it has stopped, and the door has no keyhole: a rod runs from its lock into the great gear train on the wall. Get the mechanism moving and set the right hour.",
  "winTitle": "The mechanism turns",
  "winText": "The great clock strikes a quarter past four, the rod slides back and the door swings open. Somewhere behind you, the little brass bird sings once more.",
